# reactions_combat.tscn's reactions, as a rules sheet (CbRules: docs/looks.md, Rules sheets). Plain paths are
# from the scene's root.

# Hurt
on combat.hurt if is_local
    subject $other
    at point
    flash rgba(0.8, 0.05, 0.05, 0.24) time 0.3

# Died
on combat.killed if is_local
    subject $other
    at point
    flash rgba(0.6, 0, 0, 0.55) time 1.2
